  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sqrt{2}=y_1+a_1$，",
        "这里 $y_1$ 是第一次近似值，而 $a_1$ 是它的误差，那么",
        "$2=y_1^2+2y_1a_1+a_1^2$，",
        "或",
        "$2\\approx y_1^2+2y_1a_1$.",
        "由此得：",
        "$a_1\\approx\\frac{2-y_1^2}{2y_1}$.",
        "于是，",
        "$y_2=y_1+\\frac{2-y_1^2}{2y_1}=\\frac{y_1^2+2}{2y_1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果",
        "$\\sqrt{2}=y_2+a_2$，",
        "这里 $y_2$ 是第二次近似值，而 $a_2$ 是它的误差，那么得到：",
        "$a_2\\approx\\frac{2-y_2^2}{2y_2}$",
        "和",
        "$y_3=y_2+\\frac{2-y_2^2}{2y_2}=\\frac{y_2^2+2}{2y_2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地，如果 $y_{n-1}$ 是在第 $(n-1)$ 步得到的近似值，那么",
        "$y_n=\\frac{y_{n-1}^2+2}{2y_{n-1}}$",
        "或",
        "$y_n=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(y_{n-1}+\\frac{2}{y_{n-1}}\\right)$，",
        "$n=2,\\ 3,\\ 4,\\ \\cdots$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果知道 $\\sqrt{2}$ 的某一个近似值，利用这个公式就能求出它后面的",
        "一个近似值. 同时，在给定准确度的范围内，当连续两次的近似值相",
        "同时，就得到了必需的准确度. 下面，我们举例说明."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假设需要计算 $\\sqrt{5}$ 精确到 $0.001$ 的值. 对于寻求 $\\sqrt{5}$ 逐次近似值",
        "的公式将具有下面的形式，就是："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "207"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
